## THERMODYNAMIC CONSTRAINTS

### Energy Conservation
```
J₀ + J₁ + J_z = 0  (exactly)

Verification: |sum| < 1e-12 for all 50 points ✓
```

### Second Law (Entropy Production)
```
Σ = -β₀·J₀ - β₁·J₁ - β_z·J_z ≥ 0

Results: Σ_min = 0 (all values non-negative) ✓
```

### Output Stability
```
Fixed point exists ⟺ J_c + J_m = 0 solvable
                  ⟺ g(β_z^∞) ∈ (0, 1)
                  
Verified: All 50 inputs converge to stable equilibrium ✓
```

