## COMPARISON: Thermodynamic vs Quantum Logic

| Aspect | Quantum NOT | Thermodynamic NOT |
|--------|-------------|-------------------|
| Input | Qubit state \|ψ⟩ | Temperature β₁ |
| Operation | Unitary gate | Steady-state dynamics |
| Dissipation | Minimized | Inherent to function |
| Energy cost | O(ΔE) | O(ΔT·S) |
| Speed | Picoseconds | Nanoseconds |
| Robustness | Fragile | Thermodynamically stable |
| Scalability | Exponential resource | Linear (via TT) |

